{"id": "4ad60297-e13c-4995-8759-1d34fd2ab90a", "slug": "nexus-v3-neural-cores", "title": "Nexus v3 - Neural Cores", "description": "Neural Cores UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus v3 - Neural Cores\"\ndescription: \"Neural Cores UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF5C00\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF8A00\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus v3 - Neural Cores\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 12; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, threejs, navigation, links.\n## Overview\nNeural Cores UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nNEXUS v3 NEURAL CORES CORE ASSIST DATA NEXUS START FREE TRIAL A ACCELERATOR FUNDED | COHORT A12 Neural networks you can fully rely on We construct dynamic Data Cores from your enterprise streams, deploying autonomous ne…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Neural networks you can fully rely on.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF5C00, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF8A00, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse -apple-system for display moments and -apple-system for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus v3 - Neural Cores</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Typography System */\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #050505;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle Grid Background */\n        .bg-grid {\n            background-size: 50px 50px;\n            background-image:\n                linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 40%, transparent 100%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 40%, transparent 100%);\n        }\n\n        /* Premium Border Gradient Wrapper */\n        .gradient-border-wrapper {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\n        }\n\n        /* Custom selection color */\n        ::selection {\n            background-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        /* WebGL Canvas Positioning */\n        #canvas-container {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 1024px) {\n            #canvas-container {\n                width: 60%;\n                left: 40%;\n                mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 20%);\n                -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0%, black 20%);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* Specific text gradients */\n        .text-gradient-orange {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF8A00 0%, #E52E71 100%);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Grid Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-grid pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"relative z-20 flex justify-between items-center py-5 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-white/[0.08] backdrop-blur-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <span class=\"text-[#FF5C00] font-medium tracking-wide text-sm\">NEXUS v3</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden lg:flex space-x-12\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-white transition-colors\">NEURAL CORES</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-white transition-colors\">CORE ASSIST</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:text-white transition-colors\">DATA NEXUS</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"bg-white/[0.05] hover:bg-white/[0.1] border border-white/[0.1] text-white text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest py-2 px-5 rounded-sm transition-all duration-300\">\n            START FREE TRIAL\n        </button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center px-6 lg:px-12 pt-16 lg:pt-0 max-w-7xl\">\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start\">\n\n            <!-- Badge -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-8 opacity-0 translate-y-4\" id=\"hero-badge\">\n                <div class=\"bg-[#FF5C00] text-black text-[10px] font-medium px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-sm\">A</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 tracking-[0.15em] uppercase font-light\">\n                    ACCELERATOR FUNDED <span class=\"mx-1 text-gray-600\">|</span> COHORT A12\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Headline with Masked Reveal Structure -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[4.5rem] leading-[1.05] font-normal tracking-tight mb-8\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">Neural</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">networks</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">you</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">can</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">fully</span></div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block text-[#FF5C00] translate-y-[110%] opacity-0\">rely on</span></div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Subheadline -->\n            <p class=\"text-base lg:text-lg text-gray-400 mb-10 max-w-lg font-light leading-relaxed opacity-0 translate-y-4\" id=\"hero-subhead\">\n                We construct dynamic Data Cores from your enterprise streams, deploying autonomous networks trained to seamlessly resolve complex operational challenges.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- CTAs -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 mb-20 opacity-0 translate-y-4\" id=\"hero-ctas\">\n                <!-- Primary Button with inner glow and gradient border effect via box-shadow -->\n                <button class=\"relative group overflow-hidden rounded-sm\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF5C00] to-[#FF8A00] opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#FF5C00] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(255,92,0,0.2)] group-hover:shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(255,92,0,0.4)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                        <span class=\"text-black text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase relative z-10\">INITIALIZE CORE</span>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n\n                <!-- Secondary Button -->\n                <button class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 group\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase\">VIEW DOCUMENTATION</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-gray-500 group-hover:text-white transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Stats Grid -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-8 pt-8 w-full border-t border-white/[0.08] relative opacity-0\" id=\"hero-stats\">\n                <div class=\"gradient-border-wrapper absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px]\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight mb-2 text-white\">94%</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">RESOLUTION RATE</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight mb-2 text-white\">0.01%</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">ERROR MARGIN</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col col-span-2 sm:col-span-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light tracking-tight mb-2 text-white\">48 hrs</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">SETUP TIME</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Trusted By Footer -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full border-t border-white/[0.08] mt-auto\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-4 py-6 px-6 lg:px-12 opacity-0\" id=\"hero-trusted\">\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase pr-4 border-r border-white/10\">TRUSTED BY</span>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 flex-wrap\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-widest\">ACME</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-widest\">STELLAR CORP</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-widest\">NOVA</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-widest\">ZENITH</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-widest\">APEX</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n            // Badge Reveal\n            tl.to(\"#hero-badge\", { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.8, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.2);\n\n            // Staggered Word Reveal (Masked)\n            tl.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                stagger: 0.08\n            }, 0.3);\n\n            // Subhead & CTAs\n            tl.to([\"#hero-subhead\", \"#hero-ctas\"], {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1\n            }, 0.8);\n\n            // Stats & Footer Fade In\n            tl.to([\"#hero-stats\", \"#hero-trusted\"], {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power2.inOut\",\n                stagger: 0.2\n            }, 1.2);\n        });\n\n        // --- Three.js Abstract Neural Core WebGL Animation ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Camera setup to sit correctly within the viewport\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 15;\n            camera.position.x = 2; // Offset slightly to right\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ antialias: true, alpha: true });\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Create an abstract \"Core\" network\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 700;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n            const connections = [];\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                // Sphere distribution\n                const radius = 5 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2;\n                const theta = Math.random() * 2 * Math.PI;\n                const phi = Math.acos((Math.random() * 2) - 1);\n\n                posArray[i * 3] = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.cos(theta);\n                posArray[i * 3 + 1] = radius * Math.sin(phi) * Math.sin(theta);\n                posArray[i * 3 + 2] = radius * Math.cos(phi);\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n            // Material for the nodes\n            const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.05,\n                color: 0xff5c00, // Orange\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.8,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Add inner glowing core\n            const coreGeometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(2, 2);\n            const coreMaterial = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0xff3300,\n                wireframe: true,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n            const coreMesh = new THREE.Mesh(coreGeometry, coreMaterial);\n            scene.add(coreMesh);\n\n            // Inner solid dark core\n            const solidCoreMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x050505 });\n            const solidCore = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(1.9, 2), solidCoreMat);\n            scene.add(solidCore);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            // Mouse interaction for subtle parallax\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX / window.innerWidth) - 0.5;\n                mouseY = (event.clientY / window.innerHeight) - 0.5;\n            });\n\n            const tick = () => {\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Rotate networks\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n                coreMesh.rotation.y = -elapsedTime * 0.1;\n                coreMesh.rotation.z = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n\n                // Subtle mouse parallax\n                camera.position.x += (mouseX * 2 - camera.position.x + 2) * 0.05;\n                camera.position.y += (-mouseY * 2 - camera.position.y) * 0.05;\n                camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                window.requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n            };\n\n            tick();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize WebGL after DOM\n        if (typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n            initWebGL();\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-v3-neural-cores.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-v3-neural-cores.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-v3-neural-cores-DESIGN.md", "views": 70, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T00:27:53.113575+00:00"}